Spoiler alert...

 For the first question: Yes on all three.

 For the second question: Yes.  And refer to answer #1.

I'm gonna give another spoiler alert because this is a valuable spoiler
in the game, especially if you're a priest or lawful.  So hit "n" to
skip.



You can #dip regular potions into fountains (and you can turn sinks into
regular fountains) to make potions of water.  You need to dip them twice
though.  This gives you something to do with those stupid potions, like
blindness and hallucination.

You can also #dip into moats if you are levitating over them.

There are also other ways.  For a hint: Try experimenting with that
wand of cancellation.


